The functions are designed to copy small amounts of data to user‐
space.   The routines provide the following functionality: Stores
a byte of data to the user‐space address Stores a byte of data to
the user‐space address This function is safe to  call  during  an
interrupt  context.   Stores a word of data to the user‐space ad‐
dress This function is safe to call during an interrupt  context.
Stores a long word of data to the user‐space address Stores a un‐
signed  long word of data to the user‐space address Stores a word
of data to the user‐space address The functions return 0 on  suc‐
cess or ‐1 on failure.
